\alias{Compositionalasmr-package}
\docType{package}
\title{
Simplicial Spatial Median Regression for Compositional Data
}

\description{
The alpha spatial median regression is performed via the iteretively reweighted least
squares (IRLS) algorithm. At first the alpha-transformation is applied and then the
non-linear regression model is fitted.
}

